        <item>Fun fact: I can hear the treat jar open from three rooms away 🍪</item>
        <item>I practise my peeking every day. Am I good at it? 👀</item>
        <item>My ears pick up Wi-Fi. Probably. 📡</item>
        <item>I once chased my tail for a whole minute. I won 🌀</item>
        <item>Belly rubs are my favourite. Head pats are a close second 🐾</item>
        <item>When you send a doodle, I wag so hard my whole body wags 🎨</item>
        <item>Momos are tiny pillows you can eat 🥟</item>
        <item>My nose is a professional snack detector 👃</item>
        <item>If you find a white hair on your screen, it\'s mine. Sorry! 🐕</item>
        <item>Napping is a skill, and I\'m very skilled 😴</item>
        <item>I keep all your secrets. Except where the treats are 🤫</item>
